# Paths and text that make a change need written evidence (read by scripts/check-risk).
# Project layer: the globs follow this project's planned layout (architecture.md, Targets and
# Package); revise them when the Xcode skeleton exists.
#
#   t2        the change needs an ADR in docs/decisions/ or a line "T1 because ..." in a
#             work/*/plan.md, either changed by the same change set
#   security  the change needs "security pass" in a work/*/plan.md changed by the same change set
#   *-text    a regular expression matched against the lines the change adds
#
# category       pattern
t2               **/*.entitlements
t2               **/Package.swift
t2               **/project.yml
t2               **/*.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj
t2               **/Migrations/**
t2               **/*Schema*.swift
t2-text          \bimport (GRDB|Firebase|Supabase|Alamofire|RevenueCat)\b
security         **/*.entitlements
security         **/Info.plist
security         **/PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy
security-text    \b(SecItem\w*|kSecClass|NSAppTransportSecurity|requestAuthorization|AuthorizationCenter)\b
